msgstr "Espólios de Guerra são obtidos através de:[br/][br/]Matar <<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> pertencente a <<m:{GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink}>>, <<m:{GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink}>> ou <<m:{GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} Unidades I concedem {T1Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} Unidades II concedem {T2Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} Unidades III concedem {T3Reward}[warspoils/] .[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} Unidades IV concedem {T4Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} Unidades V concedem {T5Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> concedem {HeroReward}[warspoils/] por nível.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Conquistar <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bulletlist][bullet/] concede {WarspoilsConquestBase}[warspoils/] + {PopWarspoilsConquest}[warspoils/] por {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} que a cidade conquistada tinha.[/bulletlist][br/]{GLOBAL.PillagingConcept.Hyperlink} Províncias concedem +{PillageReward}[warspoils/]."

