msgstr "Alvo:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sofre dano que ignora {EXSANGUINATE_DEFENSE_BYPASS>MODIFIERS>ResolvedArmor}% o de {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink} e {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Ganha {amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink} por {BLEEDING_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

